  "notes": "<p>Archive containing the statics, modal and timeseries results (*.csv or *.txt) of package WP2.2 from the OC7 project Phase II.</p>\n<p>Load cases included: LC2.1-2.5, LC3.1-3.6, LC4.1, LC5.1-5.2, LC6.1-6.3, LC7.1-7.3</p>\n<p>The load cases are defined in the definition document [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21220820\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21220820</a>]:<br />.\\01_DEF\\OC7_WP2p2_Description_REV12.xlsx</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>LC2.1</td>\n<td>Static Hub Load Check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC2.2</td>\n<td>Static Gravity Load Check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC2.3</td>\n<td>Static Freely Floating Check - linear stiffness in x, y and around z</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC2.4</td>\n<td>Static Freely Floating Check - with mooring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC2.5</td>\n<td>Static Current Drag Load - with mooring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.1</td>\n<td>Natural Frequency Analysis - unconstrained - Floater only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.2</td>\n<td>Natural Frequency Analysis - unconstrained - Floater and WTG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.3a</td>\n<td>Natural Frequency Analysis - floating in water - with mooring - rigid hull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.3b</td>\n<td>Natural Frequency Analysis - floating in water - with mooring - flexible hull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.4</td>\n<td>Free Decay Surge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.5</td>\n<td>Free Decay Heave</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC3.6</td>\n<td>Free Decay Pitch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC4.1</td>\n<td>Time Varying RNA Load</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC5.1</td>\n<td>Regular Waves - Constrained </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC5.2</td>\n<td>Regular Waves - Freely Floating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC6.1</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves Only - Constrained</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC6.2</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves Only - Freely Floating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC6.3</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves + RNA Load - Freely Floating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC7.1</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves Only - Constrained</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC7.2</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves Only - Freely Floating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LC7.3</td>\n<td>Irregular Waves - Waves + RNA Load - Freely Floating</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
